cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these results, please cite them as below."
type: software
title: "Speaker-Independent Speech Emotion Recognition on RAVDESS: From MFCCs to Speech Foundation Models"
abstract: >-
  Code, out-of-fold predictions and report for a strictly speaker-independent
  comparison of handcrafted acoustic features and frozen speech foundation models
  (WavLM, HuBERT, XLS-R, Whisper) on the RAVDESS speech corpus, with nested
  leave-one-speaker-out selection, end-to-end fine-tuning, a protocol-inflation
  analysis, a contamination check and a per-clip comparison with human listeners.
authors:
